[b]Known limitations[/b]

[list]
[*]The Spectrum promotion UI supports queen promotion only in 1.0.
[*]MQTT retained game-state restoration is not part of this release.
[*]The target remains 48K, so overlay latency, tight RAM, and contention are deliberate constraints.
[/list]

